Subject: how to 'force' gvisTable() to keep the row names of my data frame
Message-ID: <_6gEujOE1-M.80tNyXklmfYJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/shiny-discuss/c/_6gEujOE1-M/m/80tNyXklmfYJ>
