If you switch all your entries in DESCRIPTION that are currently imports: and change them to Depends:it may well pass.

So change this

Depends:
    methods
Imports:
    shiny,
    reshape2,
    RColorBrewer,
    rms,
    plyr

to this

Depends:
    methods
    shiny,
    reshape2,
    RColorBrewer,
    rms,
    plyr

