Hi Yihui, I have found the problem.

This app works fine :

runApp(
  list(
    ui=pageWithSidebar(
      headerPanel(""),
      sidebarPanel(
        downloadButton("dwn","download")
      ),
      mainPanel()
      ),
    server=function(input,output,session){
      output$dwn <- downloadHandler(
        filename = function() {
          "hello.txt"
        },
        content = function(file) {
          write.table(x="hello", file=file)
        }
      )
    })
  )

But with the previous version of shiny, the following equivalent app worked fine too, but it doesn't work with the current version :

fdownload <- function(){
  downloadHandler(
    filename = function() {
      "hello.txt"
    },
    content = function(file) {
      write.table(x="hello", file=file)
    }
  )
}

runApp(
  list(
    ui=pageWithSidebar(
      headerPanel(""),
      sidebarPanel(
        downloadButton("dwn","download")
      ),
      mainPanel()
    ),
    server=function(input,output,session){
      output$dwn <- fdownload()
    })
)

