Subject: Re: updating global variables
Message-ID: <3HVsdJvZ8-Q.P_9LefsF_xgJ@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <3HVsdJvZ8-Q.8RWsSAKO0-8J@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
References: <3HVsdJvZ8-Q.8RWsSAKO0-8J@shiny-discuss.groups.google.com>
